{"id":"n75852-1-10","stage":4,"title":"제값 · 应有价格","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n75852-1-10-1","ko":"아주머니, 사과 가격을 조금만 깎아 주세요.","zh":"阿姨，苹果便宜一点吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아주머니,","meaning":"大嫂，大妈，阿姨","explanation":"아주머니：大嫂，大妈，阿姨。","readings":[{"term":"아주머니","audio":"/audio/32bc34ce0694e2e28fc0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89820","senseId":"2","lemma":"아주머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아주머니","audio":"/audio/32bc34ce0694e2e28fc0.mp3"}},{"text":"사과","meaning":"苹果","explanation":"사과：苹果。","readings":[{"term":"사과","audio":"/audio/46fc35121d1a4b332863.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66371","senseId":"1","lemma":"사과","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사과","audio":"/audio/46fc35121d1a4b332863.mp3"}},{"text":"가격을","meaning":"价格，价钱","explanation":"가격：价格，价钱；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"가격","audio":"/audio/38c1b40757a204e578e9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62450","senseId":"1","lemma":"가격","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가격을","audio":"/audio/b519ef204932eea80b38.mp3"}},{"text":"조금만","meaning":"一点点，稍微，略微","explanation":"조금：一点点，稍微，略微；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"1","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조금만","audio":"/audio/61e4375f0847dd284eb0.mp3"}},{"text":"깎아","meaning":"砍价，减，扣","explanation":"깎다：砍价，减，扣；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"깎다","audio":"/audio/18d3575b885757d9618c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57278","senseId":"4","lemma":"깎다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"깎아","audio":"/audio/f7cfe0000b90afbdd50b.mp3"}},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"32bc34ce0694e2e2","term":"아주머니","zh":"大嫂，大妈，阿姨","audio":"/audio/32bc34ce0694e2e28fc0.mp3","entryId":"89820","definition":"陌生人之间用于指称或称呼已婚女子。","pronunciation":["아주머니"]},{"id":"46fc35121d1a4b33","term":"사과","zh":"苹果","audio":"/audio/46fc35121d1a4b332863.mp3","entryId":"66371","definition":"圆而红、味道酸甜的水果。","pronunciation":["사과"]},{"id":"38c1b40757a204e5","term":"가격","zh":"价格，价钱","audio":"/audio/38c1b40757a204e578e9.mp3","entryId":"62450","definition":"用钱表示的物品的价值。","pronunciation":["가격"]},{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"一点点，稍微，略微","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"微量或微小的程度。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"18d3575b885757d9","term":"깎다","zh":"砍价，减，扣","audio":"/audio/18d3575b885757d9618c.mp3","entryId":"57278","definition":"降低价格、金额、程度等。","pronunciation":["깍따"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9eb214fc7830fd4861d3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n75852-1-10-2","ko":"안 돼요. 제값도 못 받고 팔 수는 없어요.","zh":"不行，不能连应有的价钱都收不到就卖。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"돼요.","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼요","audio":"/audio/9f1cdf460348e44aca12.mp3"}},{"text":"제값도","meaning":"应有价格，合理价格","explanation":"제값：应有价格，合理价格；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"제값","audio":"/audio/f5f56c7667cbae837625.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75852","senseId":"1","lemma":"제값","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제값도","audio":"/audio/2a2300e2a13dfcbfeda0.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"받고","meaning":"收，收取，征收","explanation":"받다：收，收取，征收；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"2","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받고","audio":"/audio/e32c6bc1baf2c63b758d.mp3"}},{"text":"팔","meaning":"卖，出售","explanation":"팔다：卖，出售；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"팔다","audio":"/audio/2aa6e349da8a806dc3d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71482","senseId":"1","lemma":"팔다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"팔","audio":"/audio/aab1afda0edcd3aeba74.mp3"}},{"text":"수는","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수는","audio":"/audio/0ae6625dd24dc5dcc565.mp3"}},{"text":"없어요.","meaning":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","explanation":"없다：不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어요","audio":"/audio/a3a387384b956d187d4f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"能，行","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某个事情可行或被允许。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"f5f56c7667cbae83","term":"제값","zh":"应有价格，合理价格","audio":"/audio/f5f56c7667cbae837625.mp3","entryId":"75852","definition":"符合物品价值的价格。","pronunciation":["제갑"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"收，收取，征收","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"收下他人上缴的钱或东西。","pronunciation":["받따"]},{"id":"2aa6e349da8a806d","term":"팔다","zh":"卖，出售","audio":"/audio/2aa6e349da8a806dc3d5.mp3","entryId":"71482","definition":"收取钱财将物品或权利交给对方或提供劳动力等。","pronunciation":["팔다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/2dca8173ef8f8d5bd3f7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.857,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=75852","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":138,"sequenceScore":2.6837,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不行，不能连应有的价钱都收不到就卖。","这次假期你有什么打算吗？","阿姨，苹果便宜一点吧。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["不行，不能连应有的价钱都收不到就卖。","阿姨，苹果便宜一点吧。","这次假期你有什么打算吗？"],"answer":0}]}
